    "by": "John Mathews",
    "at": "2026-11-20T16:53:00Z",
    "via": "Claude Code",
    "note": "K183-K192, the programme builder: new cards ProgrammeBuilder (a form with the weeks beside it, in a 1184u column), ActivityCard (one line per activity, opened in a 2px ink frame), ValueField (a value's line opening into None, Stays the same or Grows), ExceptionWeekEditor (typed weeks, groups of Set to or % of planned values, and a Rest these activities checklist), StartValueEditor (a value chosen at start) and Checkbox (a 24px box with a 2px control-border, filled ink with an on-ink tick). ProgrammeGrid marks a week over an item's limit in error-ink with circle-alert; ProgrammesPage gains Build a programme and Edit; SegmentedControl allows Measure's third choice, Neither; Switch points forms with a Save at Checkbox."
  },
